  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBoSu8s.png\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252frpg-attribute-system%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=文件說明&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JnL1prm.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Brand Assets\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jauml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JAUML</a></span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款輕量級的 RPG 風格進階模組，通過根據玩家等級提供可擴展屬性來增強《我的世界》遊戲體驗。隨著玩家進度，關鍵統計數據如生命值、傷害和耐力會自動提升，創造出更加動態且具有回報感的升級體驗。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<h2><strong>功能</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RPG風格等級進階</strong><br>當玩家等級提升時，玩家屬性會自動按比例增加。</li>\n<li><strong>動態屬性升級</strong><br>生命值、傷害、防禦力、速度等隨玩家成長而增長。</li>\n<li><strong>自訂屬性系統</strong><br>完全重新設計的機制與原版《我的世界》無關。</li>\n<li><strong>可配置的擴展調整</strong><br>輕鬆調整屬性成長率、公式和等級要求。</li>\n<li><strong>簡潔用戶界面指示器</strong><br>視覺覆蓋層和工具提示顯示當前狀態和進度。</li>\n<li><strong>重新制作的物品和描述</strong><br>特別物品如《重生之卷》支持升級系統。</li>\n<li><strong>服務器和客戶端兼容性</strong><br>單人和多人模式無需額外設置即可運作。</li>\n<li><strong>優化且輕量級</strong><br>無高消耗性能系統，旨在提供流暢遊戲體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/media/media.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7VVKSsj10kA?si=Pv5R8pV20EpzEjPi\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p>\n<div>\n<h2>支持與鏈接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>文件說明： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnightbeam.gitbook.io%252frpg-attribute-system%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/rpg-attribute-system/</a></li>\n<li>Discord： <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub： <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>\n</div>",
